  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparatory Measures for the Transformation of the REAG/GARP Project - 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with IOM&apos;s developments towards a holistic, rights-based and sustainable development-oriented approach that facilitates safe and dignified return and with the changes at the European level, IOM and the BAMF have initiated a transformation of the REAG/GARP programme. The project aims to ensure and maintain support to migrants returning from Germany throughout the REAG/GARP transition process.</narrative>
  </description>
